DESCRIPTION A ribbon of fine, looping contours folds around an open center, like silk caught in a slow current. Its lines move through sea-glass green, pale gold, lavender, and soft blue against a deep charcoal-green background. Energy is 42 out of 100: a gently expressive, flowing composition. Intricacy is 58 out of 100, shaping 183 contours. Its sound uses a still-inspired five-note palette at 71 beats per minute. These are creative associations, not a reading of your emotions.
